window.products.push({"id":867184,"name":"Decorative Throw Pillow Covers 18x18 Set of 4，Velvet Solid Color Couch Square Couch Throw Pillow Covers, Decorative Pillow Covers for Sofa Bed Car (18","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-s10LYSyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Velvet Mixing Color pillow covers 4 Pack: The package contains 4 velvet throw pillow covers, which are soft and comfortable. It can refresh your bedroom, living room and sofa and give you a perfect visual experience. Decorative throw pillow covers design: The pillow cover adopts the invisible zipper design, which is beautiful and comfortable. The strong chain stitch is easy to fill and remove. Widely used: Mixing Color throw pillow covers series can be perfectly matched with all kinds of furniture. Bedroom, bed, living room, sofa, bench, floor, office, bed, car, seat, window seat, love seat, party, wedding, dining room, outdoor, etc Premium material: Mixing Color sofa 18x18 throw pillow covers is made of high-quality 100% environment-friendly fabric, which is not only soft and durable, but also will not fade and wrinkle, and is suitable for any skin. Note: The 18 inch throw pillow covers is recommended to use a 20 inch pillow, which will be more thick and comfortable. Please be informed that the products actually received will slightly deviate from the pictures. Machine wash in cold water and dry at low temperature to prolong the service life. Satisfied service: No matter what problems you encounter, you can contact us directly through Amazon information system, and we will be happy to serve you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-s10LYSyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Learife","source_asin":"B0BN6QFZVB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN6QFZVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN6QFZVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":867185,"name":"OXO Good Grips Prep & Go 4.1 Cups/1 L Divided Container | Leakproof Food Storage | Ideal for bento-style lunches and leftovers | BPA Free | Microwave ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717OuJQ0syS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The OXO Good Grips Prep & Go 4.1-Cup Divided Container features three compartments in one, perfect for bento-style lunches. Fill one side with grilled chicken and the other with veggies and grains, or use it for soup and a salad, or oatmeal with fruit and other toppings. The leakproof lid features three silicone gaskets to keep liquids contained, and two locking clips for extra reassurance. For a secure seal, press firmly in the middle of the lid, then engage the latches; you'll hear air being released as you press the lid down. Once you’ve released all the air, lock the latches on the side of the container to seal. To replace the gasket, press the four corners down, then press the rest of the gasket into place, ensuring the gasket is pressed down fully and evenly. OXO Prep and Go Containers stack neatly on top of each other for efficient and tidy storage either in the fridge or in your cabinets. The base even features stay-cool handles for easy microwave-to-table maneuvering. Although it looks like a sleek, ceramic container, it’s actually a much lighter, BPA-free, durable alternative to single-use plastic. Dishwasher, freezer and microwave safe. The containers are also odor- and stain-resistant, and shatterproof. OXO is proud to be the only Housewares partner of 1% for the Planet. 1% of OXO’s annual sales are donated to causes dedicated to helping preserve our planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717OuJQ0syS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B0BL9CV69L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL9CV69L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL9CV69L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
