window.products.push({"id":867234,"name":"Kenroy Home 60417 Ridley Classic Mirror with Flared Frame,40 Inch Height, 30 Inch Width, 2.5 Inch Ext. with Champagne Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815EilfAtIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple elegance comes in the form of the Ridley mirror. The mirror is rectangular with a 40-inch height and a 30-inch width, giving the mirror a rather large footprint. The edges of the mirror are flared, presenting a classic tray design. The frame of the mirror features champagne beads, around the inner and outer edges, delivering a very soft look and a touch of texture to the sleek mirror. This mirror can be hung vertically or horizontally, giving you versatility in how you can place it. Use it as a centerpiece on a feature wall in your living room where it can hang over a sofa or a console table. With its large size, it can bring a sense of depth to a space by reflecting the room around it or the window that it might be placed across from. Alternately, you can hang it over your vanity to bring an elegant touch to your bathroom!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815EilfAtIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenroy Home","source_asin":"B07WDY17L7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WDY17L7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WDY17L7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
