window.products.push({"id":867256,"name":"Culina® Hand-held Coarse Grater 12.5\" x 3\". Stainless Steel. Professional-grade w/Blade Protector","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7193INNEh4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"So your poorly performing plastic grater isn't meeting any of your needs? Is the plastic tool too flimsy to get any serious work done? Time to switch to a professional-grade, durable high performance tool. Culina Hand-held Stainless Steel Professional Coarse Grater is the solution to utilitarian grating by restaurant professionals and home users alike. Its rugged construction boasts a sharp blade to efficiently string cheese, raw carrots, potatoes and more! High performance suited to daily use To try our hand-held grater is to immediately love it; don't be fooled by its elegance, Culina is all about performance as it exceeds standard box graters in slicing swiftly and fast with little, to no effort. The comfortable 5\" x 2 1/2\" blade area is perfect for pizza topping or hash brown; grate over a skillet or a pasta plate. Width and length are handy for large blocks (cheese, chocolate) or smaller ingredients (ginger, nutmeg, cinnamon) or for zesting citruses. The blade is so sharp, it handles softer foods (beets, fresh out of the fridge mozzarella) without turning them into a mushy substance. Sharp Stainless Steel construction Built robust with a 18/0 Stainless Steel, Culina graters do not bend, warp or break easily. The rugged engineering translates to a nice, hefty feel in the hand. The design is stylish and functional as a wire frame extends from the front end to form a resting bar for balance and full control grating.  On the opposite end, the 5\" handle offers a safe, confident grip aided by a smart rubberized thumb rest. The wide blade area displays laser cut, etched teeth ready to slice through hard to firm food. Because it is substantially sharper than non-professional graters, it comes with a protector. The blade guard covers the entire surface for a safe storage and secure handling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7193INNEh4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Culina","source_asin":"B00YBF9S0I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YBF9S0I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YBF9S0I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
