window.products.push({"id":867297,"name":"Infinite Weaves Pillowcase Set of 2 - 300 Thread Count 100% Cotton Ultra-Soft Long Staple Sateen Weave King Size Pillow Covers - Luxurious & Fade Resi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bs6K-HXqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% PURE & NATURAL COTTON - Cozy up on this plush, ultra-soft and breathable long staple sateen weave cotton pillow cover. With an ideal 300 thread count this densely woven yet lightweight combed cotton pillow protector is sweat-wicking and temperature balancing. Stitched with generous flanged edges these pillowcases add a finishing touch to your space. SLEEP ON A CLOUD - A bed of absolute comfort is incomplete without comfy pillows. Explore our fine collection with separately available matching bed sheets. Add a subtle pop to your sofa, chair, couch or bed with these finely tailored pillow covers. This stylish pillowcase set contains- 2 pc hemstitch style envelope closure King Size Pillowcases (20\"x 40\"). BRING YOUR BED TO LIFE - These stunning pillow covers are available in an array of colors that coordinate with any decor. Remarkably color-fast and fade-resistant, this fabric is suitable for all hair and skin types. Also, the elegant one-yarn-under and three-yarn-over ventilated weave make it EASY CARE, PERFECT FIT - Easy to care and laundry at home. To keep these pillow covers fresh and clean, its recommended to machine wash in cold water with gentle cycles, do not bleach, tumble dry low or dry in shade and iron medium . The strongly woven fabric does not weaken even after several washes, while its softness and smoothness only improves with time. A PERFECT HOME DECOR GIFT - Invite yourself to lounge and relax in your favorite corner. A perfect gift for housewarming, wedding, anniversary, couples, birthday, home decor enthusiasts, Christmas, mother’s or father’s day. Add dimension and a touch of style to your sofa, chair, bed, couch, dorm bed, waterbed, airbed, pillow top mattress pad.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bs6K-HXqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Infinite Weaves","source_asin":"B081NHLPTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081NHLPTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081NHLPTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
