window.products.push({"id":867357,"name":"Beach Towel Clips Strong Beach Chair Clips Clothespin Plastic Large Clothes Pins Quilt Drying Clip to Keep Your Towel, Clothes, Blankets from Blowing ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617+BD06nEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Superior Clamping Force: Thicker and more elastic spring material gives our laundry clips strong clamping force and staying power. Can grip large and thick items without falling off. Such as quilts, beach towels, blankets, etc. Of course, it is more handy for small items, such as clothes or towels, which will not fall even if they are blown by the wind. Material: The clothespin surface is made of durable thickened high-quality PP material, with built-in springs and silicone pads, high resilience, no indentation, and no damage to items. At the same time, it will not fade when used for a long time. Beach Towel Clip Dimensions: 3.93 inches long, 2.7 inches wide, and 0.7 inches thick. The maximum clip opening is 2.36 inches. This also allows the clip to be used more widely. Multifunction: Since our beach towel clip has enough grip, you can use it to hold a lot of item, such as daily clothes, tablecloths, blankets, towels, curtains, etc., and it can also clamp small items such as snack bags. If you're an avid beach lover, this clip will keep your towel from blowing away. Of course, whether indoors or outdoors, at home or traveling, it can complete the work well. Detail Design: Our clothes clips have detachable silicone pads, which are functionally non-slip and have a good protective effect on clothes, towels and other items. simple cream and bronze color combo are very pretty and soothing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617+BD06nEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AESIFR","source_asin":"B0B33WHP84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B33WHP84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B33WHP84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":867358,"name":"Duxtop Ceramic Non-stick Sauté Pan, Induction Stainless Steel Sauté Pan, 5.5-Qt Deep Skillet with Lid, Professional Grade and Impact-bonded Technology","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bX32k21VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEALTHY FUSION NON-STICK COATING: Cooking with less oil is healthier. This Duxtop sauté pan fuses the healthy benefits of non-stick cooking with the classic style of stainless steel. The interior is coated with a FUSION titanium reinforced ceramic coating from Whitford , that's completely free of PFAS, PFOA, PTFE, Lead or Cadmium. The addition of titanium enhances non-stick properties, increases durability, and ensures better cooking performance. HEAVY BOTTOM & EVEN HEATING: The induction stainless steel pan with heavy-gauge impacted-bonded aluminum encapsulated bottom provide even and energy-efficient heating and is built to last a lifetime. Suitable for all stovetops, such as induction, gas, electric and halogen cooktops—perfect for even the most seasoned cooks. COMFORTABLE HANDLE GLASS LID: The sauté pan with lid features a classic straight-sided and drip-free pouring design. Riveted to the frying pan is a stay-cool stainless-steel perfect-grip handle, allowing for comfortable handling during cooking. The double rivets fix the handle, making it safer and durable. A clear tempered glass lid allows you to easily monitor progress and locks in moisture and heat. VERSATILE FOR All COOKING NEEDS: With a large surface area and tall, straight sides, this 11-inch non-stick sauté pan with lid combines the features of a skillet with a deep sauté pan to create a versatile piece you'll use every day. Ideal for everything from deep frying, stir-frying and sautéing to simmering and braising. USE CARE & GUARANTEE: For best performance, ceramic non-stick cookware requires to use low to medium heat with a small amount of oil or butter to cook – silicone, nylon, plastic, or wooden utensils recommended. Oven-safe to 500°F. Dishwasher-safe. Freezer-safe for food storage. Limited lifetime warranty and customer service is available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bX32k21VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"duxtop","source_asin":"B07SZGM2H3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SZGM2H3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SZGM2H3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
