window.products.push({"id":867460,"name":"Nordic Ware NW 95577 75th Anniversary Braided Rope Bundt Cake Pan, Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wk8eSfiXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This pan’s simple but beautiful interwoven strands symbolise togetherness, continuity and strength. Featuring bold, braided detailing, the cake tin can also be used for bread, moulded desserts, jellies and savory dishes as well! The Braided Bundt pan is made from heavy duty cast aluminium, which ensures even heat distribution whilst the special heat-reflective exterior assures perfect results everytime. The interior non-stick coating on the pan allows for easy release and quick clean up. Use & Care 1. Before initial use and after subsequent uses, hand wash with warm, soapy water. Extended soaking is not recommended. 2. Before each use, brush with butter or shortening and dust with flour or cocoa to coat. Baking spray containing flour may also be used. Do not use regular cooking spray. 3. Mixes and recipes may vary. Fill the pan no more than 3/4 full to avoid overflow. 4. Metal utensils, scouring pads and abrasive cleaners should not be used on nonstick surfaces. Specifications: Length – 27.3cm Width – 26.9cm Height – 10.4m Weight – 640g Capacity – 10 cups Material – Cast aluminium Warranty – Lifetime Warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wk8eSfiXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic Ware","source_asin":"B096967G49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096967G49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096967G49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
