window.products.push({"id":867519,"name":"RNK Shops Monogrammed Damask Beach Towel (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dZrpZrQQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add more fun in the sun with our personalized beach towels. They are perfect for use at the pool, at the beach, at home, or even to cover a yoga mat!! The towels are lightweight which makes them great for packing and taking on vacation. Their large surface area and absorbent material make drying off quick and easy and you'll love how soft and luxurious they feel on your skin.Go into our design center to get started creating the perfect beach towel! Choose from thousands of fun backgrounds and patterns. You get to decide exactly how it's designed. Even choose to design it vertically OR horizontally! The choice is yours. And if you need any kind of assistance, we are always happy to help!Design Shown: Monogrammed Damask (#53905)Features:==================================== * [Soft & Absorbent]: 50% cotton, 50% polyester blend provides a lightweight, absorbent fabric. * [Generous Size]: Measuring approximately 60\" x 30\", ample coverage for drying off or lounging. * [Multipurpose]: Ideal for the beach, pool, home, or as a yoga mat cover for added versatility. * [Easy Care]: Machine washable on delicate cycle, tumble dry low heat for hassle-free maintenance.Care Instructions:==================================== * Machine wash separately in cold water on delicate cycle * Do not bleach * Tumble dry low heat * Do not iron or press with heat * Do not dry clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dZrpZrQQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B00JPQ53YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JPQ53YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JPQ53YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":867520,"name":"Loose Leaf Infuser, Single Serving Tea Maker with Stainless Steel Tea Ball Strainer, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CVAkgWztL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Start enjoying loose-leaf tea and save money by using our Tea Ball Strainer . Our single-serving tea infuser is made of a non-toxic, food-grade silicone long handle that is fully removable from the stainless steel infuser tea ball . The top is vented and will NOT float in your cup, ALL of the tea gets wet! As a bonus, you get a FREE silicone drip tray to contain any potential messes! Our new tea brewer is perfect for a single serving of tea in a medium or large cup. It can be used with whole loose-leaf tea or smaller tea leaves. Please note that there are very small holes in the stainless steel tea ball that may not work for finely ground tea leaves. Our loose leaf tea infuser comes in beautiful bright colors, green and magenta, and is wonderful for expressing your personal style. The leaf tea infuser is perfect for giving as a gift (or keeping for yourself). The box has a cut-out portion with instructions for brewing the perfect cup of tea . This perfect tea steeper measures 1.6\" wide by 6.1\" tall and is great for use in even boiling water; it is heat resistant up to 465° F and is top-rack dishwasher safe for easy clean up! PLEASE NOTE: this leaf tea infuser is NOT safe for use in the microwave due to the stainless steel ball. Feel confident in purchasing our product by taking advantage of our Lifetime Guarantee, you'll absolutely LOVE our reusable tea steeper so much that you'll never go back to using tea bags again! Teapiphany's tea maker is made up of 100% food-safe silicone and is environmentally-friendly by being reusable. Our personal guarantee... Teapiphany's Leaf-Shaped Tea Infuser is only made of high-quality materials and as such, we personally guarantee the quality of the product with our lifetime guarantee against defects!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CVAkgWztL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teapiphany","source_asin":"B00OCBDK78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OCBDK78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OCBDK78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
