window.products.push({"id":867604,"name":"5 Pieces Chocolate Silicone Molds Semi Sphere Silicone Mold Round Cylinder Candy Mold Ice Cream Bar Mold with 2 Pieces Mini Wooden Hammers and 50 Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714ItTxNApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  Essential baking tool: Each chocolate mould is designed with multiple cavities, which allows you bake different kinds of dessert at one time, saving your time and energy. You can use them to make jelly, muffin, melted chocolate, cheese cake, chocolate, etc.  The operation is simple: Just pour the prepared food, mix the materials, and then place it in the oven. The oven should be set at the right time and temperature, and then you will get lovely hand-made food, these molds can help the baker make more interesting cakes and desserts, which are easy to use and clean, so you can spend more time baking with your family and children.  Specifications: Main material: silicone, wood Color: as pictures shown  Package includes: 2 x Silicone molds 2 x 6-hole hemispherical chocolate molds 1 x Round cylinder candy molds 2 x Mini wooden hammers 50 x Wooden sticks  Warm notices: Please allow slight deviation due to manual measurement. Do not directly touch the open flame or close to the heat source (such as the oven heating tube). It is recommended that you place the mould in the middle or upper position of the oven during baking, and keep the distance between the heating tube at least 2 inch/ 5 cm. It is recommended that take out the baking tray after baking, and let it cool for about 10 minutes before demoulding. Use neutral detergent to clean it with a sponge normally in the dishwasher or hot water. Please turn the mould over when cleaning. Pointed items included, please keep away from children and adult supervision needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714ItTxNApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patelai","source_asin":"B08SJLMF1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJLMF1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJLMF1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
