window.products.push({"id":867670,"name":"Electric Gooseneck Kettle Temperature Control - SEIZON Pour Over Kettle for Tea Coffee 1300W Quick Heating 27oz Stainless Steel Kettle Keep Warm Auto ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K1T1uG2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRITISH STRIX THERMOSTAT CONTROL: The gooseneck kettle is equipped with British Strix thermostat control. By turning the dial, you can freely set in the temperature to your precise requirements from 104°F to 212°F, brew your favorite coffee like a pro. The wide temperature settings make it possible for one to make several drinks ranging from coffee, tea, oatmeal, and cocoa.This 27oz electric tea kettle will heat water for about 3-4 cups. 100% 304 FOOD-GRADE STAINLESS STEEL FOR PURE TASTE: All parts of the electric water kettle are made of 100% 304 food-grade stainless steel that is also corrosion resistant, include the inner lid, body and spout, no silicon or plastic or chemical linings, which maintains the pure taste of the coffee or tea without any bad smell. It’s BPA-free with both the handle and lid designed not to scorch your hands as you pour. EASY-GRAB HANDLE & 90° ANGLE OUT PRECISE SPOUT: The pour-over kettle comes with user-friendly design, with a gooseneck spout to deliver a perfectly controlled pour. For the slow, circular motion you need when making pour-over, the spout on the water kettle is tailor-made. You’ll get complete accuracy while retaining total control. Plus, an easy-grab handle makes for an perfect pour over option. All great features for making pour over coffee. SEIZON KETTLE PROTECT YOUR SAFETY: Safety is assured through an automatic shut off when the eleretic kettle is empty or when the water boils further. A concealed heating element for safe use and ease to remove anti-filter scale are some of the features this kettle possesses. The cool handle is further adding to the safety of the kettle. While your drink gets hot, the handle remains cool and makes handling pretty easier. Plus, anti-slip for maximum safety when using it. QUICK HEAT & KEEP WARM FUCTION : 1300 watts eletric pour over kettle for quick heating, boils water to the desired temperature in 3~5 minutes and under very low noise. Real-time temperature display and 60-minute keep warm button that maintains your drink at desired temperatures until you’re ready to drink it. LED display help indicate what the water temperature is so that you can know the progress of your drinks clearly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K1T1uG2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIZON","source_asin":"B08SW59L85","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SW59L85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SW59L85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
