window.products.push({"id":867675,"name":"Everplush Bath Towel, 30\" x 56\", Charcoal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1bq3wyJECL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Absorbent towels don’t dry quickly, and quick-dry towels don’t absorb a lot of water. Now there’s a towel that absorbs a lot of water and dries very quickly, and drying off will never be the same. Powered by Ever plush technology, Ever plush bath towels, hand towels, washcloths, and bath towel value packs and towel sets are plush luxury that perform and last. The Flat Loop Terry towel collection feels like soft cotton towels but perform like a microfiber towel. Outer loops of cotton feel soft, while the inner loops of microfiber absorb water like a quick-dry towel. With a traditional terry towel look, the Flat Loop Quick-Dry Bath Towel is an everyday linen that will fit any bathroom aesthetic. They are available as white towels, grey towels and dark grey towels. Ever plush stays true to its name, outlasting ordinary cotton towels while staying super soft, plush, and absorbent with every use. Ever plush makes a great gift for graduates, gifts for women, and gifts for weddings or gifts for any special occasion. Use the washcloths to replace makeup wipes and disposable makeup removers. The quick dry hand towels make great fitness towels, microfiber face towels, spa towels and gym towels. The oversized bath towels feel like plush cotton bath towels or luxury spa towels but will last longer than hotel bath towels. Ever plush towels are also available as kitchen towels, yoga towels, beach towels, dish towels - check out the video for more information about how the Ever plush technology works.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1bq3wyJECL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Everplush","source_asin":"B0C5MKN5GY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5MKN5GY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5MKN5GY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":867676,"name":"AlorAir 180 PPD Smart WiFi Dehumidifier, 28 Gallons Commercial Dehumidifier for Home, Basements, Garages, and Job Sites, Industrial for Disaster Resto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1599.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CVCiZeL3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【New advanced SLGR technology】 Storm SLGR 850X dehumidifier uses SLGR (Super Low Grain Refrigerant) technology to remove more water from the air and consume less power than previous designs. This commercial dehumidifier removes 180 PPD (Saturation), 85 Pint (AHAM) while drawing only 5.9 amps of electricity. Truly achieve small size big performance. ✔【App Control】 In addition to the performance benefits and tough compact size, the dehumidifier has a Smart Wi-Fi App Control, Monitor and control your machine, wherever you are. Maintaining a healthy 25%-80% humidity range has never been easier! Ideal for removing damp and moisture from flood & restoration, carpet cleaning, basements/cellars, Laundry, de-flooding, or anywhere you need to extract moisture at a professional level. ✔【Dehumidifier with pump for easy drainage】There is no doubt how a commercial dehumidifier with a built-in pump can ease your life. The build-in pump is the key ‘set it and forget it’ feature. ✔【Plug and go, easy read & operation】Simplified user controls include a large LCD display and APP control.-It has no complicated function button, temperature, and humidity display at both Inlet and outlet sides, is ideal for water damage restoration projects, has a clear LCD display, easy to read even from a far distance, so you can get any job site done with just a few buttons. ✔【5 Years Warranty】Safety tested our Storm SLGR 850X dehumidifier is fully compliant with the electrical safety ETL. Every AlorAir dehumidifier comes with a 5-year warranty with a professional customer support team ready to assist at any time. Please feel free to contact us; you deserve the best after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CVCiZeL3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALORAIR","source_asin":"B0B9SFDFTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9SFDFTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9SFDFTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
