window.products.push({"id":867801,"name":"Fairbridge Metal Thawing Plate, Fast Tray-The Safest Way to Defrost Meat or Frozen Food Quickly Without Electricity, Microwave, Hot Water or An, L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p8UBbzx9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Color:GreenEveryone has, on occasion, forgotten to take the frozen meat from the freezer in preparation for the evening meal, then either hurriedly defrosted it in the microwave (partially cooking the edges) or having to buy a last minute \"fast food\" meal. The Mocatrend Defrost tray solves this common problem by allowing you to defrost frozen food up to 10 times faster than at room temperature! The Powerocean Defrost Tray requires no electricity, chemicals or heating! In fact, the tray will be completely cool to the touch! Simply place the defrost tray onto your kitchen counter and add your frozen food to the top. I know this all sounds too good to be true, so here's a simple test. Place an ice cube onto the defrost tray and another onto a normal household plate, watch as the ice cube on the Defrost Tray melts before your eyes! Thawing times will vary depending on the thickness of the meat but on average it will take between 30 and 60 minutes, much quicker than leaving in the fridge which can take 24hrs to fully defrost and quicker and safer than at normal room temperature, which can take 10 hours. Leaving meat out at room temperature for long periods of time is also unhygienic, allowing bacteria to spread. The Powerocean Defrost Tray is simple to clean, needing only soap and hot water. As always, use precautions when handling raw meat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p8UBbzx9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fairbridge","source_asin":"B06Y6P67R7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y6P67R7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y6P67R7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":867802,"name":"Spectrum Diversified Sweep Wall Hook Rack, 5 Hook Single Rack, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719N1j2I49L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hang up your coats, hats, jackets, and accessories without sacrificing style thanks to the Sweep Wall Mount 5-Hook Rack from Spectrum Diversified. The graceful arc of hooks holds essentials in every room. Store coats, hats, handbags, scarves, purses, and backpacks in the bedroom or closet. Display mugs, grocery bags, and light skillets and cookware in the kitchen. Hang towels, robes, and headbands in the bathroom. Tidy up coats, scarves, purses, bags, and jackets in the entryway. Conserve shelf space by utilizing walls for storage. Stylish hooks turn storage into wall art. Show off your favorite mugs, collection of colorful scarves, or antique cookware for a unique touch to any room. The empty rack looks stylish and chic, adding some functional fashion to your walls. Easily attach the organizer to your wall. Brackets are built into the design for easy and straightforward mounting; simply secure the organizer to the wall by inserting the screws into the holes and a pre-drilled hole in the wall, then tighten the screws until the rack feels firmly fastened. Mounting hardware included. Included mounting system designed for attaching to wood; alternative surfaces may require specialized hardware. Steel is strong enough to support your accessories, hats, towels, robes, scarves, bags, backpacks, purses, and more without bending or breaking. Hook rack is reinforced with horizontal rods to support hooks and the items on them. Made of sturdy steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719N1j2I49L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B0BFCLFKRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFCLFKRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFCLFKRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
