window.products.push({"id":867920,"name":"JJMG 2-in-1 Garlic Press Dicer Mincer Slicer Box Cutter Stainless Steel Cube Kitchen Tools Utensils Soft-Handled Crush Cloves Ginger, Rust Proof, Easy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rTffjBX7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Ergonomic Design - This 2-in-1 Garlic Press in a box is designed to make things easier for every household to mince, dice, and slice garlic without the need to go mess and deal with odor that sticks on your hands and fingertips! Just put the cloves or any veges inside the presser and you're good to go! Its Storage Container made this presser unique as it stores the minced garlic in it leaving no mess, no odor at all! Improved and Enhanced - The sharp and strong kitchen accessories (graters) allow you to cut any soft vegetables aside from Garlic such as ginger, onions, small mushrooms, chili, celery, peppers, and fruits like apple, banana, pears, cantaloupe, watermelon, mango, kiwi, strawberry, and a lot more! It comes with Easy to Use and Clean - Effortlessly cuts through soft vegetables and fruits by pressing down the top presser against its grater(s). No need to spend much time removing bits that are stuck in between. Just give it a quick rinse under the tap water or run through the dishwasher. It saves you a lot of time from having to scrub your press after use. Durable Materials - High-quality construction with stainless steel blades and plastic material safe to use with Food. Dimension: 8.5 x 7.3 x 7.3cm (approximately 3.35\" x 2.87\" x 2.87\"); Package Includes: 1 set with 2 graters included - for minced and sliced choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rTffjBX7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JJMG","source_asin":"B06XG6N8N1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XG6N8N1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XG6N8N1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":867921,"name":"Nightstand with Charging Station and USB Ports,Brown Record Player Stand,Night Stand 3 Cube Storage Shelf,Mid-Century Modern Bedside Table with Drawer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+uyaBt3AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Make Energy Within Reach 】 This rustic brown nightstand with charging stand is equipped with two standard outlets and two USB ports which can easily charge your phone, tablet, and even your laptop. The 6.56 ft long power supply cord allows you to move this modern night stand freely,and the portable design makes life more comfortable! Also, the proper distance between plugs ensures no space fighting for an outlet. Low battery? No worries! No need to look around! It’s within your arm’s reach! 【 Mid-Century Modern Bedside Tables 】 This bedside table uses a rustic brown natural wood grain design with solid wood decorative legs. It retains the retro wood texture, but without losing the modern pop style. An organic aesthetic, delicate linear detail, and novel Partition storage design bring iconic style to this mid-century bed side table.Its essence lies in the perfect combination of exquisite retro tones and new design concepts, highlighting the style and texture of furniture matching! 【 Reliable Materials Create Stable Structure 】 The strong wooden nightstand is made of EPA certificated board and solid wood legs reinforced by special screws to ensure durability and stability. Thickened tabletop and reinforced table legs not only ensures large weight capacity(65 lb), but also creates a clean-cut silhouette for a touch of visual intrigue. The high-quality materials used in the small end side table with charging stand escort your safe and healthy life. 【 Small Footprint But Large Storage Space 】 The 3 cube modern nightstand with drawer adopts a simple vertical design, which reduces the complexity and saves space to a great extent. Its size is 16.35 '' L x 13.4 '' W x 27.01'' H . Show your beloved photos and an alarm clock to remind you on the desktop of this suitable sized bedside table. The simple but practical drawers allows you to easily organize your daily necessities and make your life elegant and exquisite 【 More role playing & Easier Installation 】 This bedside table with can also be used as a record player stand to display your beloved record!The spacious 3 rectangular storage spaces can hold more than 100 records. In order to make your installation more convenient, the multifunction bedside tables for bedroom comes with step-by-step instructions and all marked tool parts. You can put them together as easily as playing a game of blocks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+uyaBt3AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joaxswe","source_asin":"B09TKYSKP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-867921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKYSKP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKYSKP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
